          "type": "text",
          "text": "Good question! `git commit` only records the change in your local repository - it doesn't send anything to GitHub. Your branch is currently 1 commit ahead of `origin/fix/topic-filter`, which confirms the commit is local only. You'll need to run `git push` before your teammate can pull it down."
