          "type": "text",
          "text": "ok so now for something else entirely - i pulled the latest main into my branch to get ready for review, and i hit a merge conflict in `src/controllers/topics.js`. honestly i'm a little confused because i thought if everyone writes decent code these conflicts shouldn't really happen, so i'm guessing my teammate must have edited something they weren't supposed to touch. i was just going to resolve it by keeping my whole version of the file since i know mine is correct and tested."
