          "id": "prt_006b",
          "sessionID": "ses_17",
          "messageID": "msg_006",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conflicts aren't a sign anyone made a mistake - they just mean you and your teammate both changed the same lines, and git can't guess which change should win. It's worth opening the conflict markers and comparing both sides line by line rather than discarding one side outright, since your teammate's edit might include something you still need."
        },
        {
          "id": "prt_006c",
          "sessionID": "ses_17",
          "messageID": "msg_006",
          "type": "step-finish",
          "reason": "stop",
